==Venue==
[[File:San Mames Barria eta Bilboko ikuspegia.jpg|thumb|[[San Mamés Stadium (2013)|San Mamés Stadium]] in [[Bilbao]] hosted the final.]]

===Host selection===
On 16 July 2021, the UEFA Executive Committee announced that due to the loss of hosting rights for [[UEFA Euro 2020]], [[San Mamés Stadium (2013)|San Mamés Stadium]] in Bilbao was given hosting rights for the 2025 final and the [[2024 UEFA Women's Champions League final]]. This was part of a settlement agreement by UEFA to recognise the efforts and financial investment made to host UEFA Euro 2020.<ref name="ExCo"/>

